---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="ShotMark Updates" description="What is new in ShotMark: Projects, Grid and List browsing, pinned screenshots, and earlier improvements." canonicalPath="/updates/">
  <main id="main-content" class="document-page wrap">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Updates</p>
      <h1>Small details.<br />A better daily habit.</h1>
      <p class="lede">New ways to keep useful screenshots close, without adding complexity.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="v2-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Version 2.0</p>
        <h2 id="v2-title">More room to organize.</h2>
        <p>Choose Grid or List to browse your library, pin important screenshots, and bring related screenshots and Collections together with Projects in ShotMark Pro.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Projects for organizing a larger task, alongside your existing free Collections.</li>
          <li>Grid and List views, with sharper thumbnails that adapt to their size.</li>
          <li>Pinned screenshots for the references you reach for often.</li>
          <li>Updated navigation and a native iPad layout for browsing and reviewing cards.</li>
          <li>Refined System, Light, and Dark appearance.</li>
          <li>On Mac, an updated sidebar and familiar menu and drag-and-drop organization.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your existing screenshots, notes, and Collections stay in place. Creating and changing Project organization requires Pro.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="v132-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Version 1.3.2 · August 2026</p>
        <h2 id="v132-title">Sharing and language polish.</h2>
        <p>Improved iCloud syncing for cards saved from the Share Sheet. Added German, Japanese, French, Italian, Portuguese, and Spanish, with further improvements to Simplified and Traditional Chinese and localized layouts.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="v131-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Version 1.3.1 · June 2026</p>
        <h2 id="v131-title">More reliable iCloud sync.</h2>
        <p>Reduced unnecessary sync activity, strengthened protection for deletions across devices, and improved handling of synced files and CloudKit updates.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="v13-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Version 1.3 · May 2026</p>
        <h2 id="v13-title">Your library, across devices.</h2>
        <p>Introduced optional iCloud sync with Pro, Chinese language support, and text detection for everyone. Improved recognition of Chinese and mixed-language screenshots and made settings more compact.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="v12-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Version 1.2 · May 2026</p>
        <h2 id="v12-title">Find it. Copy it. Share it.</h2>
        <p>Added detected-text search with Pro, copying text from screenshots, and card image exports. Refined capture, editing, and text selection.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="v11-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Version 1.1 · April 2026</p>
        <h2 id="v11-title">A home for related screenshots.</h2>
        <p>Introduced Collections, library search, date filters, timeline groups, and cards with multiple screenshots. Improved previews and saving from the Share Sheet.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="store-title">
        <h2 id="store-title">Get the latest version</h2>
        <p>See the App Store for the version available on your device and its full release notes.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6761759060">View ShotMark on the App Store <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
